OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for throwing Molotov
OL,4,Acocktails at homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been jailed after throwing
OL,7,FMolotov cocktails through the windows
OL,8,Fof three separate homes in south Wales
OL,9,Fover the course of less than six hours
OL,10,Fon the same day.
OL,12,FYasin Hussain, 18, and Adam
OL,13,FTaylor-Morris, 19, were driven down
OL,14,Ffrom Scotland by Taylor-Morris' sister
OL,15,Fon 1 June 2026, thereafter travelling
OL,16,Fin taxis between the three targeted
OL,17,Fhouses.
OL,19,FAt one home, the petrol-filled bottle
OL,20,Fignited on impact and could have caused
OL,21,F"serious injury or loss of life",
OL,22,Fpolice said.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
